    "rationale": "Present risk is a property finding under rubric section 5a: consequential production capabilities include configure actions, one of which is irreversible, and the design lacks attributable provenance because actions run under the engineer's delegated identity while the only request record is deletable chat history. Declared controls limit who can access the assistant and record actions in the cloud audit log, but they do not restore non-repudiation. Manual validation applied because scripts could not be run in this environment."
